      "writtenOn": "2025-02-05T17:45:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we have to, because if `CONFIG_MEMFD_ASHMEM_SHIM` is not defined, the stub implementations of these functions [1] will kick in, and I implemented them such that they return as if they weren\u0027t defined (e.g. if `.ioctl()` isn\u0027t defined for a file, the fs code does return `-ENOTTY`).\n\n[1] https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/d43bc741a9317f3d6ca574fe6d7e60176c8a52e7/mm/memfd-ashmem-shim.h#27",
      "parentUuid": "7dcb591e_8ad94c64",
      "range": {
